# ==============================================================================
# GriView - .gitignore
# License: by cs.baguosps@gmail.com
# ==============================================================================

# --- Operating System & Temp Files ---
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~

# --- IDE & Code Editors ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# --- Logs & Debugging ---
*.log
error_log

# --- Sensitive Credentials & Environment ---
.env
.env.*
app/data/business_profile_token.json

# --- Private Audit Exports & Temporary Job Caches ---
# Mencegah file excel laporan audit nyata terunggah ke repositori publik
app/data/exports/*
!app/data/exports/.gitkeep
app/data/latest_extension_job.json
app/data/last_audit_export.json
app/data/*.tmp

# --- Uploaded Assets (Opsional: simpan aset kustom di luar git jika bersifat privat) ---
# Jika ingin aset logo & thumbnail kustom tidak diunggah ke publik, uncomment baris berikut:
# assets/uploads/*
# !assets/uploads/.gitkeep
